---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="Version History | Arasmas Labs">
  <main class="history-page">
    <section class="history-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">VERSION HISTORY</p>

      <h1>Built in Iterations.</h1>

      <p>
        Arasmas Labs is developed as an evolving system. This page records
        significant changes to the laboratory, its projects, its website,
        and the infrastructure supporting them.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="timeline">

      <article class="version-entry">
        <div class="version-meta">
          <p class="version-number">v0.3</p>
          <p class="version-date">August 2026</p>
        </div>

        <div class="version-content">
          <h2>Launch Preparation</h2>

          <p>
            The Arasmas Labs website completed its first full design and
            content pass in preparation for public launch.
          </p>

          <ul>
            <li>Completed the visual and content polish for the primary site pages.</li>
            <li>Added dedicated banner artwork for Projects Theseus, Daedalus, and Hephaestus.</li>
            <li>Refined the shared navigation and project-page presentation.</li>
            <li>Completed the About and Contact pages.</li>
            <li>Published the first official Arasmas Labs blog posts.</li>
            <li>Prepared the website for its first public deployment.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="version-entry">
        <div class="version-meta">
          <p class="version-number">v0.2</p>
          <p class="version-date">August 2026</p>
        </div>

        <div class="version-content">
          <h2>Development Infrastructure</h2>

          <p>
            Arasmas Labs entered active website development with a local
            Astro development environment and a modular component-based
            architecture.
          </p>

          <ul>
            <li>Established the Astro development environment.</li>
            <li>Implemented shared navigation, layout, and footer systems.</li>
            <li>Created dedicated pages for Theseus, Daedalus, and Hephaestus.</li>
            <li>Established reusable project landing-page architecture.</li>
            <li>Implemented a functional blog publishing system.</li>
            <li>Integrated Decap CMS for browser-based blog publishing.</li>
            <li>Added support for drafts, images, and individual article pages.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="version-entry">
        <div class="version-meta">
          <p class="version-number">v0.1</p>
          <p class="version-date">2026</p>
        </div>

        <div class="version-content">
          <h2>Foundation</h2>

          <p>
            The initial Arasmas Labs framework was established as an umbrella
            for independent technical development, experimentation, research,
            and practical fabrication.
          </p>

          <ul>
            <li>Established Arasmas Labs as the central project identity.</li>
            <li>Defined Project Theseus around development of the Nyx AI ecosystem.</li>
            <li>Defined Project Daedalus as the experimental research and development space.</li>
            <li>Defined Project Hephaestus as the practical fabrication and business initiative.</li>
            <li>Established the initial Arasmas Labs website architecture.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

    </section>
  </main>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .history-page {
    max-width: var(--content-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-7) var(--page-padding);
  }

  .history-header {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-7);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
  }

  .history-header > p:last-child {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .timeline {
    border-top: var(--border-width) solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .version-entry {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-5);

    padding: var(--space-5) 0;
    border-bottom: var(--border-width) solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .version-meta p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .version-number {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .version-date {
    margin-top: 0.25rem !important;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .version-content {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .version-content h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .version-content p,
  .version-content li {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .version-content ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .version-content li + li {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .version-entry {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-2);
    }
  }
</style>
